-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/BROD> <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/ref/Lexicon/hasLithologyDescription> "Lenticular granodiorite body c. 1km x 100m, elongated NE - SW."@en .
-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/CAGA> <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/ref/Lexicon/hasLithologyDescription> "Diorite."@en .
-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/CULV> <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/ref/Lexicon/hasLithologyDescription> "Minor pluton of pyroxene diorite, with two small subsidiary outcrops (each c. 200m diameter) to the south of the main body. An associated breccia-filled vent lies about 0.5km to the west of the main body."@en .
-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/DOON> <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/ref/Lexicon/hasLithologyDescription> "Major zoned granitic pluton. Isotopic age 408.6 +/- 2.8 (RB-SR); 408 +/- 4 (K-Ar)."@en .
-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/GLUC> <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/ref/Lexicon/hasLithologyDescription> "Diorite."@en .
-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/BALW> <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/ref/Lexicon/hasThicknessDescription> "Elongate sheet c.4.5km x 0.2km, orientated NE - SW."@en .
-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/BROD> <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/ref/Lexicon/hasThicknessDescription> "c. 1km x 100m vertical intrusion."@en .
-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/BUHD> <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/ref/Lexicon/hasThicknessDescription> "Elongate intrusion c. 1.7km x 0.5km with long axis orientated roughly E - W."@en .
-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/CULV> <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/ref/Lexicon/hasThicknessDescription> "Elongated body c. 2km x 0.7km, with long axis orientated c. 075 degrees"@en .
-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/DOON> <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/ref/Lexicon/hasThicknessDescription> "'Hour-glass' shaped intrusion c. 19km x 11km with long axis orientated roughly N-S."@en .
-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/SPAN> <http://data.bgs.ac.uk/ref/Lexicon/hasThicknessDescription> "Elliptical pluton c.5km x 2.4km, orientated NE - SW."@en .
-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/DISKD> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Igneous intrusive bedrock. Occurs onshore. Emplaced during the Silurian Period - to - Devonian Period (443.1-359.3 Ma BP)."@en .
-<http://data.bgs.ac.uk/id/Lexicon/NamedRockUnit/TNHL> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Igneous intrusive bedrock. Occurs onshore. Emplaced during the Silurian Period - to - Devonian Period (443.1-359.3 Ma BP)."@en .
